# Package files
# Deliberately ignored in the template so a new project resolves the newest
# compatible design system at first install. Commit your own lockfile once the
# project is under way — some hosts (Cloudflare) detect the package manager
# from it, and without one they may fall back to bun, which cannot resolve the
# design system's #semver: git range.
package-lock.json

# Design system artefacts synced from @bydefaultstudio/design-system by
# bd-sync on npm install. All regenerated on every sync — never hand-edited.
assets/css/design-system.css
assets/css/design-system/
assets/js/design-system/
assets/icons/icons.svg
assets/icons/cursors.svg
DESIGN.md

